Metadata Fixer is a new implementation inspired by these projects:

arXiv Workflow for Zotero (AllanChain and contributors)
https://github.com/AllanChain/zotero-arxiv-workflow
Inspected commit: 0edf0484986c3f0045cccbdec2142f4e27a1da70
Upstream license: AGPL-3.0

Linter for Zotero (northword and contributors)
https://github.com/northword/zotero-format-metadata
Inspected commit: 2b747409e8c3df866fca327a8ad859d770694a5b
Upstream license: AGPL-3.0

Zotero Metadata Hunter (Federico Torrielli and contributors)
https://github.com/federicotorrielli/zotero-metadata-hunter
Inspected commit: a436abe0dc670aff4db550ba7c7c899b74aa1a58
Upstream license: EUPL-1.2

The three upstream plugins are not bundled or required at runtime.
Build-time dependencies and their licenses are recorded in package-lock.json.

Zotero Google Scholar translator (Zotero contributors)
https://github.com/zotero/translators/blob/master/Google%20Scholar.js
Inspected installed translator: 57a00950-f0d1-4b41-b6ba-44ff0fc30289, updated 2025-12-11
Upstream license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
The translator source is not bundled.
